# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF. Windows checkouts may still show CRLF in
# the working tree, but `git status` stops reporting whole-file changes caused only by
# line endings. Windows-only scripts keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
